{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_st01",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_st01",
  "title": "路口的紅綠燈",
  "storyCode": "SS-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e5386f5ba7194f6861e8edd6d87f0c1ec97f27b485719ad731192a71099c8858",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊哈，今天的化裝舞會也很成功！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們有注意到安可時大家激烈的歡呼聲了嗎？！有個孩子，一看就是喵姆親的超級粉絲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我出場的時候，她的眼睛都變得閃閃發亮了！真是讓人開心啊~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等到下次舞會的時候，要不要再多加幾個和粉絲互動的環節呢~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祐天寺小姐，研究如何增加魅力是沒關係啦，但希望你不要忘記遵守Ave{@nbs}Mujica的世界觀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸……祥子，這麼怕我搶走觀眾的喜愛啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的粉絲只是沉浸在了Ave{@nbs}Mujica的化裝舞會裡罷了。讓他們也迷上Mujica，這樣不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕是站姿，也屬於表演的一部分。直到最後一秒，我們都不能鬆懈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們的使命就是讓被邀請來的客人沉醉在這場舞會裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為此，我們得將充滿說服力的世界觀全面地呈現給大家——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道了，知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過呢~睦子登場的時候才是歡呼聲最大的時候吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“真開心啊~”、“希望粉絲更多一點~”睦子真的不會有這樣的想法嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……沒有……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請你不要煽動睦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈……大家不要這樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是覺得大家應該都很期待下次的演出啦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在喜歡我們的人這麼多，我們就應該乘勝追擊，用百分之百的努力去回應他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這幾天閣樓上的檯燈一直到很晚才熄燈……小祥正在盡最大的努力製作新曲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這段時間以來，Ave{@nbs}Mujica的每個人都在努力，我怎麼可以落後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小祥……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祥子不可以把自己累壞了哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們都能感受到小祥你的心意，我也會努力創作出與新曲相配的歌詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛才演出前豐川同學讓我聽了Demo，是首不錯的曲子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我倒是覺得……節奏可以再慢一點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？！你們都已經聽過了嗎？什麼時候？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就在剛才開演前，你好像不在休息室裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本來是想收集全體成員的意見，但因為時間緊迫就先給當時在場的人聽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若麥拉我去她的直播頻道客串……我也沒聽到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祐天寺，我不是說過不能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "綠、綠燈要亮起來了！我們先走過去再說吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，真是頭痛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……真好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？為什麼突然這麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽了小祥你剛才的那些話，我也深有感觸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "經歷了這麼多，即使有爭吵，我們五個人還能在一起組樂隊……真好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然沒有問過，但我相信，大家一定都是這麼想的……尤其是我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於我自己，能被小祥你這樣信任，真的很開心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真想把我的人生都奉獻給Mujica！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子順著初華的視線望去，幾個少女正嬉鬧著穿過人行道。\n她們無憂無慮，彷彿一切都和童話一樣美好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然沒有說，但是大家都很感謝小祥。若麥也說過，她的夢想也在Mujica實現了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，一切都和以前一样……感覺就像做夢似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……做夢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們兩個不要在這裡吵啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是要我捨棄樂隊這個定位嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正是不是樂隊我都無所謂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說到底，有什麼必須拘泥於樂隊這個形式的理由嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再說了，睦子本人又沒意見，她還在電視節目裡說“不可能長久”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別說樂隊這個形式，我看她就連退出Mujica也根本不在乎吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我不會讓Mujica解散的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼扯到這裡了？我沒有說要解散啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "成員退出就代表解散，這等於背叛了支持我們的觀眾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的意思是剛才就已經背叛了。更何況，初子嘴上說得好像很重視，其實你忙得幾乎沒來練習過吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這樣太不負責任了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼這樣說……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要說負責的話，祐天寺小姐你才該多練習吧？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我從不覺得祐天寺小姐缺乏練習過。豐川同學，是你不關心其他成員吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在初華快步追上前方的同伴時，祥子卻只是恍惚地站在人群之後。\n她出神地看著交替閃爍的交通號誌燈，雙腿卻像灌了鉛一般，無法移動半步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂——你還在那邊傻傻站著幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八幡海鈴",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有什麼東西忘拿了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "若葉睦",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……祥，綠燈要結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小祥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "忘東忘西的，我們不會等你的哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "提醒行人通過的提示音急促地鳴響著，祥子想要跟上大家的步伐，可惜號誌燈已經變成了紅色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一輛輛車飛馳而過，祥子撩起被風吹亂的髮梢，號誌燈的光映照出她面龐的輪廓。\n有什麼落在了她的手心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "水……下雨了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雨滴從天空落下，越來越快，越來越多。\n驀然間，她似乎想起了許多事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周遭的聲音在耳邊不斷放大，人群的喧鬧、汽車的鳴笛，不由分說地穿透她的耳膜。\n雨水浸濕了她的衣衫，和淚水混雜在一起。\n她的悲傷與無助不能告訴任何人，但她仰面失控的號哭又說明了一切。\n刻骨銘心的悵然與失落襲捲而來，她的視線也和回憶一同變得模糊不清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "匡噹，匡噹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祥子，祥子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太陽曬屁股啦，該起床囉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "紅……紅豆小姐？是夢嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是夢哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "紅豆！不要捏我的臉？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還不是想幫你確認一下嘛，而且我也沒用多大力吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（掐掐自己的臉蛋）喏，還好吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一大早突然被人捏臉，誰都受不了吧？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啦好啦，不欺負你了。快點收拾一下，我在外面等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "耳朵貼在微涼的牆壁上，透過艦船相連的結構，依稀能聽見動力層全速運轉的聲音。\n匡噹，匡噹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來是動力層的聲音啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個奇怪的場景，還有那些人……到底是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是說——你夢見了一群完全不認識的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……嗯。還有夢裡的那個場景，我也從來沒有見過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從未見過的交通工具、陌生的建築，還有她們的穿著……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說不定是電影裡的場景？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有時睡前看記錄片，也會夢到自己來到了記錄片裡的地方……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是之前並沒有發生過類似的事情……"
