    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是不是最近太累了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前幾天鞭刃小姐還和我說，你每天都訓練到很晚，只有等到她來提醒，你才肯結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有，在最新的工程部志工名單上，我好像也看到了你的名字……"
