    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且讓一個新人來負責這種複雜工作，對她來說，壓力也太大了吧？"
