    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這位是新加入的實習幹員，祥子，和你們一樣，也是來自維多利亞，現在跟著我做一些後勤的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而這兩位幹員，愛麗絲和貝娜……嗯……怎麼介紹呢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦！是“仙女”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，“仙女”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，紅豆，由我們自己來介紹吧。這種情形我們之前遇過很多次，已經很熟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祥子小姐是維多利亞人的話，應該看過不少當地童話吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小時候在故事書裡讀過一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你相信它們是真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你問我相不相信……小時候確實會一直追著媽媽問這種問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就是現在不相信囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不是這個意思——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但童話裡說的都是真的喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“在維多利亞的森林裡，矗立著一座夢城堡，裡面住著帶給孩子們美夢的仙女。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這種地方真的存在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祥子，我記得你還沒有成年吧？你那些奇怪的夢，也許和仙女有關？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "未經過孩子的允許，擅自進入他們的夢境，對於仙女來說是不可原諒的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夢除了是自身想法的映射，同樣也是想法形成的過程。對於心思細膩的孩子來說，更是如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有些夢，甚至可以改變一個孩子的一生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我們雖然為孩子們帶來美夢，但夢的內容到底是什麼，以及什麼時候將夢帶給他們，都要徵求他們的同意後，再慎重考慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實我的那些夢，也很難被稱作“美夢”……甚至讓我困惑不已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果之後愛麗絲沒有那麼忙了，可以讓她幫你解一下夢哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "愛麗絲，你們應該很久沒有休息過了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們停留在羅德島的時間實在太少了，所以之前祥子才一直沒有機會認識你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "愛麗絲是夢城堡的主人，很多事都需要她親自操勞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉——可惜“造夢”這方面，我完全不行，不然就能幫愛麗絲多分擔一點了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）雖然也有其他有造夢天賦的人……但那個“孩子”實在太危險了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那這次你們也是和以前一樣，要為孩子們帶來美夢嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是，也不是……\n愛麗絲，可以說嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……這件事，由我自己來說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一年前，我無意間翻到一本童話書，裡面的故事深深吸引了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我順著扉頁留下的地址，和書的作者成了筆友。我們透過書信往來交流彼此對童話的見解與想像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是最近，她的回信越來越少，我也很久沒有收到她的消息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到兩天前，我又收到了她的信，裡面附上了一篇未發表的作品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "故事的主人公有個暴躁易怒的父親，並且她還被所有同齡人孤立……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那篇作品跟她以前寫的故事完全相反，而她和我說……那就是她真實的人生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "信的最後，即將成人的她提到了自己的生日，日期是……明天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天啊，竟然還沒有成年……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "結尾的那句話，讓我無論如何都無法釋懷……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她說她不想長大……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<i>“這是我的最後一封信。”</i>"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……距離明天，還有不到十二個小時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。這就是愛麗絲如此著急的原因，我們必須儘快趕到小鎮，找到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "司機",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "路況實在太差了，車子爆胎了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "灼陽之下，滾燙的熱浪侵蝕著每個人的皮膚。\n接下來，是漫長的等待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
